# 13. AI Troubleshooting Assistant

Add an AI assistant panel on the analysis page.

Users should be able to ask questions such as:

* "Why is this component suspicious?"
* "How can I test this component?"
* "How do I check this PCB using a multimeter?"
* "What should I check before powering the PCB?"
* "What is the function of this component?"
* "Could this cause overheating?"

The assistant should answer at an ECE beginner-friendly level.

Avoid claiming certainty when the image alone cannot prove a fault.

