**"AI-generated results are preliminary visual observations and should not be treated as a confirmed electrical diagnosis. Always switch off power before inspecting a PCB and verify suspected faults using appropriate instruments, schematics, datasheets, and qualified supervision."**

Never instruct users to work on a powered PCB when unsafe.

